# Files that run on Linux (the server, containers, CI) are checked out with LF on every
# machine, whatever core.autocrlf says. Git for Windows defaults to autocrlf=true, which
# gave the CI Windows runner a CRLF server/llamacpp/models.ini and broke a guard's
# LF-joined search (2026-10-13). PowerShell, Markdown and the rest keep each clone's
# own setting: some .ps1 files are stored CRLF on purpose, and nothing here changes them.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.ini   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.tsv   text eol=lf
